cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software release when using the Python workflow, and cite
  Yassin et al. (2019) separately for the reservoir model formulation.
type: software
title: "DZTR: reservoir parameterization, simulation and calibration workflow"
authors:
  - family-names: Yassin
    given-names: Fuad
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8179-7928
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: MIT
url: https://fuadyassin.github.io/DZTR_model/
repository-code: https://github.com/fuadyassin/DZTR_model
abstract: >-
  Modular Python implementation of the dynamically zoned target release
  reservoir model, with observation normalization, data-availability-specific
  target estimation, mixed-year calibration, checkpointed optimization and
  frozen-profile application. Public examples and reproducibility checks
  accompany the release. Conditional forcing, regional donor assumptions,
  source limitations and unproven convergence remain explicitly documented.
keywords:
  - reservoir operation
  - hydrological modeling
  - parameterization
  - calibration
  - reproducibility
